**/*.shade.typeshade.ts
# TypeShade entry/parameter decorators extend the TypeScript parser grammar. The glob selects every
# kernel file under src/: in src/gpu/ and in the gpu/ subdirectories (docs/library-structure.md,
# section 3.1).
src/**/*.shade.ts
# These three kernel files hold no decorator, and format:check checks them (the same document,
# section 2, "The glob", and section 4, rule 1). The lines name no directory, so the three stay
# checked when they move.
!src/**/epipolar.shade.ts
!src/**/numerics.shade.ts
!src/**/projective.shade.ts
